# Project flow canvas

React Flow workflow editor under `apps/web/src/components/projects/`. Graphs persist via `/projects` API → `data/projects/` on disk. Run execution is still preview-only (mock console).

## Node roles

| Role | Shape | Controls |
|------|--------|----------|
| `trigger` / `action` / `agent` | Main workflow | Bottom `ProjectFlowCanvasActionBar` on select |
| `config` | Circular sub-node (plugin / model) | Floating `ProjectFlowSubNodeToolbar` above node — **not** bottom bar |
| `note` | Sticky markdown card | Floating sticky toolbar + bottom bar hidden |

## Sub-node profiles (`project-subnode-config.ts`)

Capabilities vary by **agent slot**, not one toolbar for all config nodes:

| Profile | Slot | Toolbar | Edge hover |
|---------|------|---------|------------|
| **model** | 0 (Chat model) | Power · Delete · More — **no Execute** | Delete only |
| **plugin** | 1 Memory, 2 Tool, data nodes | Play · Power · Delete · More | Delete only (no insert +) |

Resolve profile with `getSubNodeCapabilities(project, node)`. Add new profiles in `PROFILE_DEFS` — do not hardcode in toolbar components.

## Edge hover (`ProjectFlowEdgeHover.tsx`)

- **Main** edges: insert (+) + delete when `edgeHoverAllowsInsert()` is true
- **Config** edges: delete only; model sources never get insert (+)

Logic lives in `project-flow-connect.ts` + `project-subnode-config.ts`.

